    "description": {
      "content": "The HashiCorp Vault KV (Key/Value) secrets engine API provides endpoints for reading, writing, versioning, and managing secrets stored in Vault. KV v2 supports secret versioning, metadata management, soft delete, and permanent destruction of secret versions. All paths are mounted under the KV engine mount point (default: secret/).\n\nContact Support:\n Name: HashiCorp Support",
